   {
    "row": 5,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 11,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "ples, quotes, and citations was judged to be key to helping users reach an informed understanding.",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 578,
     "end": 676
    },
    "digest": "6b6c2883a7ca8ad3f677c4acc0cda3759b3ffc1a19f180b94f212abb236fc160"
   },
   {
    "row": 6,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 11,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "Tuning element extraction prompts may help to retain more of these details in the GraphRAG index.",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 676,
     "end": 773
    },
    "digest": "8523afdec92a0807fcd809f953e3012d5985a370b1f77e80130a984c1cec6264"
   },
   {
    "row": 7,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 11,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "Community summaries vs. source texts. When comparing community summaries to source texts",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 773,
     "end": 861
    },
    "digest": "b6712e7e489db92b1569c2c2030892dbabe23172710e883ca5aaeb39a99d1d83"
   },
   {
    "row": 8,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 11,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "using GraphRAG, community summaries generally provided a small but consistent improvement",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 861,
     "end": 950
    },
    "digest": "030fb3bdc94156ede6c2a97f0774b1884b4637e3db4dfd180d40c22478c5c9cf"
   },
   {
    "row": 9,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 11,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "in answer comprehensiveness and diversity, except for root-level summaries. Intermediate-level",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 950,
     "end": 1044
    },
    "digest": "b51ed1ec88ccc22050cb5ac83dd8ae5d0f5f3770c5fac022e3f19f659acfff20"
   },
   {
    "row": 10,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 11,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "summaries in the Podcast dataset and low-level community summaries in the News dataset achieved",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 1044,
     "end": 1139
    },
    "digest": "a7d142a125f91afaad8bc166fe7c5919f51bd0ec019f5d80d44aa885990d3107"
   },
   {
    "row": 11,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 11,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "comprehensiveness win rates of 57% (p&lt;.001) and 64% (p&lt;.001), respectively. Diversity win rates",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 1139,
     "end": 1240
    },
    "digest": "ce37550507ef9c0b1d4254ab7d10b47a279c288139e14e44a50f78e983175d1d"
   },
   {
    "row": 12,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 11,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "were 57% (p=.036) for Podcast intermediate-level summaries and 60% (p&lt;.001) for News low-level",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 1240,
     "end": 1337
    },
    "digest": "1c27e4d88473179c5df2b19b985790a22d77958482b0d3ed4dcac00fdb9f4a31"
   },
   {
    "row": 13,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 11,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "community summaries. Table 2 also illustrates the scalability advantages of GraphRAG compared",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 1337,
     "end": 1430
    },
    "digest": "4213c5cad78ea5280e33afb4a42723be6c63678db467395896a58cb71b749f94"
   },
   {
    "row": 14,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 11,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "to source text summarization: for low-level community summaries (C3), GraphRAG required 26-",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 1430,
     "end": 1521
    },
    "digest": "9b630dfb864692cc1eae898ebf61694021bd99fb1496e86af1c17d4937629dd6"
   }
